kuna is derived from Ghidra (https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra),
released under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The decompiler engine and the
SLEIGH compiler are a Rust port of Ghidra's C++ decompiler and SLEIGH compiler
(sleigh_opt); the SLEIGH processor specifications (specs/Ghidra/Processors/)
and the decompiler regression corpus (tests/datatests/) are vendored from
Ghidra. The pinned upstream commit is recorded in docs/UPSTREAM.md.

